    "title": "Vacancy for Logistics Manager at Speed Post India Advisory Limited",
    "description": "Speed Post India Advisory Limited invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Logistics Manager at our Aurangabad location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Speed Post India Advisory Limited:\nSpeed Post India Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Oversee end-to-end logistics operations for timely delivery\n• Implement cost-saving initiatives in transportation and warehousing\n• Conduct periodic vendor audits and evaluate logistics partners\n• Prepare MIS reports on delivery performance and SLA adherence\n• Manage relationships with third-party logistics providers\n• Manage a fleet of vehicles and coordinate with drivers\n• Coordinate with customer service teams to resolve delivery issues\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Sc / M.Sc in Life Sciences\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in Freight Forwarding\n• Proficiency in Cold Chain Logistics\n• Proficiency in Inventory Management\n• Proficiency in 3PL Management\n• Proficiency in Customs Clearance\n• Proficiency in Fleet Management\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Learning & development budget\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Aurangabad, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Speed Post India Advisory Limited!",
